Scope

This license covers crates/replay-core, crates/replay-wasm, crates/replay-nif
and the rest of this repository, EXCEPT crates/bw-engine.

crates/bw-engine is NOT licensed under the MIT License. Parts of it are
derived from OpenBW (https://github.com/OpenBW/openbw), which does not publish
a license, so no license is granted for that crate. See NOTICE for details.

Builds that include crates/bw-engine (replay-wasm with its default `map` or
`sim` features) contain that unlicensed code. The parser-only build
(`replay-wasm --no-default-features`) and replay-nif do not.
